{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>馬來西亞女神林明禎雖然不時傳出緋聞，但一直就未有公開認愛，感情狀況一直都撲朔迷離。近日她於社交網出Post，她晒出拎住一幅寫住「MC YY」的圖畫，並嘟嘴合照，而她上載的其他照片中，還見到另一名男士都手執另一幅寫住「MC YY」的圖畫，網民推測「MC」疑為「Minchen」縮寫，因而推斷「YY」是另一男士名字，惹起她有新戀情疑雲。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T09:43:54.712711+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T09:01:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T10:57:13.225551+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T09:37:16.679799+00:00","content_hash":"e56cde1645ddc5b5db407c950b4fb64530eb814874cf6a0db97a88e54b3d9a5e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T09:43:54.712711+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}